WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You cross a doorway and forget why you entered. That feeling is real.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But one experiment is not a universal law about memory.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A 2021 study failed to find a general doorway-forgetting effect.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Context, working-memory load, and the kind of memory test matter.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying audio, ask which benefits were tested on that product.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try twelve quiet minutes, read the sources, and decide for yourself.
